        end_time_formatted: "2026-12-03 23:59",
        detail: "Kass Blount & The Burners | One Year Anniversary Opening Night Thu, Dec 03 Kass Blount & The Burners | One Year Anniversary Opening Night \n One year ago, on December 3, Kass Blount & The Burners helped us quietly open the doors to Hotel Eve. Now, exactly one year later, we\'re bringing them back to the stage where it all began to kick off our One Year Anniversary Weekend. \n \n Kass Blount & The Burners ignite the stage with soulful fire, blending smoky, velvet vocals, rich saxophone, and sophisticated grooves. Moving effortlessly between sultry and spirited, this quintet of Asheville\'s finest musicians breathes fresh life into timeless jazz classics with daring improvisation, playful chemistry, and undeniable soul. \n \n FEATURING \n Kass Blount: Vocals \n Dylan Hannan: Saxophone & Flute \n Alex Taub: Keys \n Danny Iannucci: Upright Bass \n Ryan Ptasnik: Drums \n \n CELEBRATING ONE YEAR OF JAZZ AT HOTEL EVE \n \n What began with a quiet opening last December has grown into a year of extraordinary music, remarkable artists, and a community that continues to show up for live jazz in Asheville. \n \n We\'re kicking off our anniversary weekend with the musicians who helped us open our doors, followed by our main anniversary celebration Friday evening with The Steve LaSpina Celebration Quintet & Special Guest Christian Howes AND Hard Bop Explosion on Saturday. \n \n We\'d love to see the room filled with familiar faces and new friends alike. Reserve your favorite table, bring someone who hasn\'t discovered us yet, and help us celebrate the music and musicians who made our first year possible. \n \n THURSDAY ADMISSION: $10/Door \n Advance reservations recommended. \n \n Join us for a weekend celebrating one year of jazz at Hotel Eve! \n Read More 07:00 PM SHOW 08:30 PM SHOW",
