        end_time_formatted: "2026-12-10 23:59",
        detail: "Lazy River Sit Down Band, Featuring Members of the Acclaimed Hustle Souls Band Thu, Dec 10 Lazy River Sit Down Band \n \n Featuring members of the acclaimed soul-rock band Hustle Souls , the Lazy River Sit Down Band brings a fresh, spirited approach to traditional jazz. Drawing inspiration from Louis Armstrong, Benny Goodman, Leon Redbone, and Preservation Hall Jazz Band, the quintet blends timeless jazz favorites with a handful of original compositions. \n \n With lively horns, infectious rhythms, and a nod to the golden age of New Orleans jazz, this is music made for settling in and savoring. \n \n Sit down, tune in, relax, and enjoy. A Show not to miss! \n \n FEATURING \n \n Billy Litz - Trumpet & Vocals \n Justice Mann - Trombone \n Kevin Scott - Drums \n Reid Parler - Guitar \n Jonathan Taylor - Bass \n \n $10/Door. Advance Reservations are strongly recommended. \n Read More 07:00 PM SHOW 08:30 PM SHOW",
